<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") -%>
    <main>
        <div class="container py-4">
            <div class="p-md-5 mb-4 bg-body-tertiary rounded-3">
                <div class="container-fluid py-5 ">
                    <div class="container-fluid row">
                        <div class="col-12 text-center mb-4">
                            <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">Join us</h1>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 offset-md-3">
                            <form action="/join_us" method="POST">
                                <div class="mb-4">
                                    <select class="form-select" name="helper_type" id="helper_type">
                                        <option value="seller">Become a Seller</option>
                                        <option value="delivery">Become a Book Hero & Help Us With Delivery</option>
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mt-4 mb-4 d-flex justify-content-center">
                                    <button class="btn" id="illHelpBtn">Yes, I will help.</button>
                                </div>
                            </form>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <p class="fs-6 fs-md-4 text-center">If you'd like to help out in any other way, please don't
                                hesitate to reach out to us. <br> We would love to hear from you!
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 d-flex justify-content-center mt-2">
                            <p class="fw-bold">contact@campusbookdrop.store</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row align-items-md-stretch">
                <div class="col-lg-6  mb-3">
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="sellBooksJumbotron">
                        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Why Sell Your Books With Us?</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="sellBooksJumbotron">
                        <p>
                            Ready to declutter your bookshelf and earn some extra cash? Sell your books through us and
                            enjoy a
                            hassle-free experience that saves you time and money.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="sellBooksJumbotron">
                        <p>
                            If you are looking to sell your used textbooks and help out your fellow college students?
                            You've come to the
                            right place! Our platform makes it easy to connect with buyers and get the most value out of
                            your books.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="sellBooksJumbotron">
                        <p>
                            We know you're busy, and selling your old books can be a pain. But with our user-friendly
                            website and
                            dedicated support, you can make the process simple and stress-free.
                            <br>Plus, you'll be doing your part to
                            promote <span class="text-bg-success px-1 rounded-2">sustainability</span> and reduce <span class="text-bg-warning px-1 rounded-2">waste</span> on campus!
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6  mb-3">
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="bookHeroJumbotron">
                        <h2 class="fw-bold">Why Help Us Deliver?</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="bookHeroJumbotron">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold"> Gain Work Experience </h4>
                        <p>
                            Joining our team of Book Heroes is an excellent opportunity
                            to gain valuable work experience that can help you build your resume and prepare for your
                            future career. As a Book Hero, you'll learn skills in logistics, customer service, and
                            time management that are highly sought after by employers. Join us today and start building
                            your skills while making a difference in your community!
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="bookHeroJumbotron">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold"> Flexible Schedule </h4>
                        <p> 
                            Our Book Hero position is flexible and can fit around your
                            class schedule.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="bookHeroJumbotron">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold"> Network Building </h4>
                        <p>
                            By becoming a Book Hero you will get the opportunity to
                            network with other students and potentially build connections for future career
                            opportunities.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="bookHeroJumbotron">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold"> Community Involvement </h4>
                        <p>
                            Joining as a Book Hero will not only save other college students money on textbooks but
                            also involve you in the local community, making a positive impact. It's a rewarding
                            experience that you wouldn't want to miss!
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 p-5 border rounded-3" id="bookHeroJumbotron">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold"> Perks and Rewards </h4>
                        <p>
                            Although we are not be able to offer monetary compensation, we can
                            consider offering other perks and rewards to you or your team of Book Heros. For example,
                            we can offer discounts on textbooks sold
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>